== Usage ==
'''Caducous Feeder''' can be used on any [[Pet]] to consume an {{Item|Ultimate Carrot Candy}} and instead grant it {{Green|1,650,000}} pet experience. The item has {{Yellow|2}} charges, and reloads after {{Green|20}} hours. Carrot Candies fed in this way don't count toward the candy limit. It cannot be used on pets that are max level.

=== Transfer ===
Due to it being {{Rift Transferable}}, the '''Caducous Feeder''' can also be transferred to the [[Hub]] through the Ender Chest next to {{NPCSprite|Inverted Sirius}}. Once in the [[Hub]], the '''Caducous Feeder''' can be used as intended.

